
PROJECT: Robust Object Detection in Low-Visibility Environments

This project includes and uses GroundingDINO, an open-vocabulary object detection framework developed by IDEA Research.

GroundingDINO source code and associated materials retain their original authorship and licensing notices and are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Original GroundingDINO repository:
https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO

Original research paper:
https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.05499

Project-specific work includes fog and blur augmentation scripts, video inference integration, confidence filtering, temporal detection persistence, and the Gradio-based interface.

These project-specific components are presented as academic project contributions and should not be confused with the original GroundingDINO implementation.
